{"1416070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "beta decay", "steam_appid": 1416070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/3d0de6c64be7cb92bbf67a3cdbc6841d.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The <strong>Roadmap</strong> for Early Access has been <strong>published</strong> and is available on the <strong>beta decay website</strong>.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/5de4014d104f373b3eadb9fed94e8c3d.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span><strong>A B O U T</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mankind has expanded its reach beyond the Sol System. Factions, corporations and syndicates are locked in a political and economic strife. The inevitable destruction and decay of a colonized exoplanet is imminent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/c6b14e511e8ef4384bd0b2fa2f89c387.avif?t=1780487874\" width=1405 height=305 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​​beta decay is a dark, dystopian RPG where you can build spaceships, join factions, and fight for territory in a newly discovered star system. Live amongst the colonists as a citizen of the new frontier. Be an engineer repairing starships, to a syndicate leader, executing raids deep within a labyrinthic neon city. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/081c6bc2b600d74676dfe90697e8870c.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A L P H A - C E N</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >beta decay presents city ruins and <strong>destruction</strong> at a scale. Deep within the earth, delve deep into a labyrinthic <strong>metropolis</strong> that is soaked with neon lights and dense crowds.​ Massive structures scrape the skylines that consist of Megatenements for housing and Megaplazas for corporate consortia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/b370ea30cd6721cc4562bc0bcb8861be.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>T P S / F P S</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in third and first person perspectives with seamless, fluid transitioning between the two. (No separate models or animations).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/a909c54f7862f3db2621322e8d31574b.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>N O W A   A T M O S F E R A</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESTETYKA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mixing the old with the new.​​ Neurologic enhancements, biological interfaces, and breakthrough technologies such as quantumtech have become a commodity amongst the population.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/390aa66f3ed5ee3d345bb54661e4a00a.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>P V E   /   P V P </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SINGLEPLAYER + MULTIPLAYER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exist with friends within the singleplayer universe.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/ec4b370e52a43d531fc6b059da47a2df.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>M C V s</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mobile Armor</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb into the cockpit of a <strong>Mechanized Combat Vehicle (MCV)</strong> and immerse yourself as a pilot flipping mechanical switches and controls. Battle with miniguns, counter RPGs with flares, or lock on and fire at your opponents with heat seeking missiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/22411b3f9be090ce8a1543f19953bb59.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>L A R G E - S C A L E</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DESTRUCTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destruction at a scale. Large vacant ruins where building walls and floors may be destructed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/41a4ff076272ec329870a8dd7d744e5c.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>W E A P O N - M O D S</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ATTACHMENTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard weapon attachments to weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/bf39d3d05b22ffe99b67c2ab83300ad8.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/58253a0cb05e5a17e8bfcb11c17c5a85.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/1617af144064f22d0f12d1ab816d8e11.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>P L A Y E R - S Y S T E M S</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COVER | PRONE | STATS | INJURY | DISMEMBERMENT and more...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/8585cdde7992ed6b5fa8f88413d561ee.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>P L A Y E R - D R I V E N</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ECONOMY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade products through physical shops on the streets to digital securities on the<strong> </strong>Centauri Exchange.​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/aa41f9f411919c26e41b0ce97e4db6e0.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>C H A R A C T E R</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your face, hair, skin color, weight, height, hair, outfit, and equipment to suit your play style.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/255aec89a19de634dd07a0946fd30710.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>P H E N O M E N O N</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take precautions against possible encounters with creatures, viruses, and hazardous areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/4d05caae6f624cef0880fec2b4a64f0c.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>H O R D E S</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against  hundreds of hostile creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/2630769d369190aff5e7023f031f79d3.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>R O G U E L I K E</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVAL + Statistics + Dismemberment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is unforgiving. Eat, drink and sleep to keep your character alive. Practice caution and avoid unnecessary risks on foreign worlds where viruses, phenomenon, and creatures may reside. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/ffb225d1734c6cdefe7c89459ccf312a.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>S P A C E - T R A V E L</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD STARSHIPS </strong> <strong>(beta + decay feature)* - <i>See the game's roadmap</i></strong>​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build spacecraft with complex sub-systems such as power grids, server networks, and life support systems to keep your crew alive in deep space. Players may go where they like, when they like, doing whatever they like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>***Note that this feature is likely to arrive throughout or Post Early Access.</strong>***</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/a86f5c3de4473dbee1a76adabfdd66bb.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A L L E G I A N C E S</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACTIONS  |  CORPORATIONS |  SYNDICATES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Faction divisions, Corporate Subsidiaries, or Syndicate Cells in an endless fight for territorial control of the Alpha Centauri star system.​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/788e80ab82c4e676b2442f5c46130d5f.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>R E C R U I T</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMMAND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit subordinates and issue commands. Deploy with a landing crew to explore the planet surface, or order your lieutenants to patrol a territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/afe61bdd3fc9a757e09ec1c13744caf8.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>O S T</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beta decay original sound track (OST) along with album cover art.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/5de4014d104f373b3eadb9fed94e8c3d.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span><strong>A B O U T</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mankind has expanded its reach beyond the Sol System. Factions, corporations and syndicates are locked in a political and economic strife. The inevitable destruction and decay of a colonized exoplanet is imminent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/c6b14e511e8ef4384bd0b2fa2f89c387.avif?t=1780487874\" width=1405 height=305 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​​beta decay is a dark, dystopian RPG where you can build spaceships, join factions, and fight for territory in a newly discovered star system. Live amongst the colonists as a citizen of the new frontier. Be an engineer repairing starships, to a syndicate leader, executing raids deep within a labyrinthic neon city. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/081c6bc2b600d74676dfe90697e8870c.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A L P H A - C E N</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >beta decay presents city ruins and <strong>destruction</strong> at a scale. Deep within the earth, delve deep into a labyrinth