85.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/1617af144064f22d0f12d1ab816d8e11.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>P L A Y E R - S Y S T E M S</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COVER | PRONE | STATS | INJURY | DISMEMBERMENT and more...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/8585cdde7992ed6b5fa8f88413d561ee.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>P L A Y E R - D R I V E N</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ECONOMY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade products through physical shops on the streets to digital securities on the<strong> </strong>Centauri Exchange.​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/aa41f9f411919c26e41b0ce97e4db6e0.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>C H A R A C T E R</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your face, hair, skin color, weight, height, hair, outfit, and equipment to suit your play style.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/255aec89a19de634dd07a0946fd30710.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>P H E N O M E N O N</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take precautions against possible encounters with creatures, viruses, and hazardous areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/4d05caae6f624cef0880fec2b4a64f0c.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>H O R D E S</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against  hundreds of hostile creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/2630769d369190aff5e7023f031f79d3.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>R O G U E L I K E</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVAL + Statistics + Dismemberment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is unforgiving. Eat, drink and sleep to keep your character alive. Practice caution and avoid unnecessary risks on foreign worlds where viruses, phenomenon, and creatures may reside. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/ffb225d1734c6cdefe7c89459ccf312a.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>S P A C E - T R A V E L</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD STARSHIPS </strong> <strong>(beta + decay feature)* - <i>See the game's roadmap</i></strong>​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build spacecraft with complex sub-systems such as power grids, server networks, and life support systems to keep your crew alive in deep space. Players may go where they like, when they like, doing whatever they like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>***Note that this feature is likely to arrive throughout or Post Early Access.</strong>***</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/a86f5c3de4473dbee1a76adabfdd66bb.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A L L E G I A N C E S</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACTIONS  |  CORPORATIONS |  SYNDICATES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Faction divisions, Corporate Subsidiaries, or Syndicate Cells in an endless fight for territorial control of the Alpha Centauri star system.​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/788e80ab82c4e676b2442f5c46130d5f.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>R E C R U I T</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMMAND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit subordinates and issue commands. Deploy with a landing crew to explore the planet surface, or order your lieutenants to patrol a territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/extras/afe61bdd3fc9a757e09ec1c13744caf8.avif?t=1780487874\" width=948 height=278 /></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>O S T</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beta decay original sound track (OST) along with album cover art.</p>", "short_description": "beta decay is a dark, dystopian RPG where you can build spaceships, join factions, and fight for territory in a newly discovered star system. Become an engineer repairing starships, a mech pilot commanding war machines, to a syndicate leader, executing raids deep within a labyrinthic neon city.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/header.jpg?t=1780487874", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780487874", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1416070/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780487874", "website": "https://www.rotoscopestudios.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 5800H with Radeon Graphics, 3201 Mhz, 8 Core(s), 16 Logical Processor(s)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Realtek (R) Audio<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> N/A<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> These are the requirements that were used to create the game. The actual requirements may be lower.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> WIndows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 5800H with Radeon Graphics, 3201 Mhz, 8 Core(s), 16 Logical Processor(s)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Realtek (R) Audio<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> N/A<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> These are the requirements that were used to create the game. The actual requirements may be lower.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><u